Follow `AGENTS.md` at the repo root (Chinese: `AGENTS.zh.md`). Do not copy that file here. Procedures: `docs/skills/`. Plan first when required: `pnpm ysk-kit plan <slug>` → `docs/plans/<yyyy-mm-dd>-<slug>.md`. New HTTP features start with `pnpm ysk-kit add module <kebab-name> --prisma --web`. Verify with `pnpm layers && pnpm typecheck && pnpm test && pnpm gen:openapi && pnpm ysk-kit check agent`. Security / Prisma / webhooks / Electron: `docs/skills/security-review.md`, `db-migration.md`, `webhook-handling.md`, `desktop-electron.md`.
